{"id":"451222","name":"鲫鱼汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/451222/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲫鱼","amount":"400克"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/451222/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉剁成沫，鲫鱼处理干净用酒和姜片腌一会儿。","img":"images/451222/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉肉加淀粉和鸡蛋抓匀。","img":"images/451222/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将肉塞进鱼肚子里。","img":"images/451222/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，油八成热时，下鱼稍微煎一下。","img":"images/451222/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入加好水的碗中，加姜片。","img":"images/451222/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入电高压锅。","img":"images/451222/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出汽后压20分钟，加鸡精、胡椒粉调味出锅。","img":"images/451222/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}